{
  "id": 8867158065351,
  "title": "Christmas Bedding Quilt – Soft Microfiber Holiday Bedsprea - Design 01",
  "handle": "christmas-bedding-quilt-soft-microfiber-holiday-bedsprea-design-01",
  "body_html": "<p>Celebrate the most wonderful time of the year with the Jeminise Christmas Bedding Quilt. This beautifully designed quilt set offers unmatched softness and comfort, perfect for bringing warmth and holiday spirit into your home. Its vibrant festive prints will add a cheerful touch to any room, making it an ideal gift for loved ones or a delightful addition to your seasonal decor.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Festive Holiday Design:</strong> Features bright, high-quality Christmas prints that create a warm, joyful atmosphere, perfect for bedrooms, living rooms, or holiday setups.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Premium Comfort:</strong> Made from soft, lightweight microfiber for year-round versatility, keeping you warm in winter and cool in warmer months.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Thoughtful Gift:</strong> A cozy and meaningful present for loved ones during Christmas, New Year, birthdays, or holiday celebrations.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Can be used as a bedspread, a festive couch throw, or a warm companion for chilly nights and outdoor adventures.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable with cold water on a gentle cycle; tumble dry low or air dry. It's fade-resistant and wrinkle-free for long-lasting softness.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in Throw (60\"x70\"), Twin (68\"x86\"), Full (80\"x90\"), Queen (90\"x90\"), and King (102\"x91\") to perfectly fit beds, sofas, or as a decorative seasonal quilt.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Sets</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Microfiber</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Christmas</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Christmas Quilt-ds07</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>Quilt</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Throw (60\"x70\"), Twin (68\"x86\"), Full (80\"x90\"), Queen (90\"x90\"), King (102\"x91\")</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine washable with cold water on gentle cycle, tumble dry low or air dry</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
